☐ Implement v0.3
    notes
        How are initial surrounding systems & galaxies generated? 
            Initially generate both number of surrounding systems
            and
            number of surrounding galaxies

        How large are systems and galaxies? 
            A System-level chunk (SLC) = 100 000 x 100 000 px / 6250 x 6250 km2

            Galaxy-level chunk (GLC) = 32x32 grid of system-level-chunks

        how to ensure each chunk stays same with same seed
            chunk generator
                get_chunk(x, y, world_seed)
                    #create hash by combining world seed with chunk coords
                    var chunk_seed = hash(Vector3i(x, y, world_seed))
                    generate_chunk(chunk_seed)
    
